  "thesis": "This strategy targets short-term momentum in liquid Indian instruments. It exploits the inefficiency that aligned moving averages (MA10 > MA29 > MA100) indicate a strong intraday trend (bullish momentum)\u301018\u2020L17-L24\u3011. This exists because institutional flows often drive extended moves after the open, and many traders miss multi-timeframe signals. The pattern persists due to friction (trading costs) and the difficulty of front-running large players.",
